        "value": "合米 五千百三十五石四斗一合四勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total rice: 5,135.4014 koku — the sum line for the four tax items counted by the 四口 note above. The printed components do not in fact add up to it. The facing page's Shinano-province rice reads 米三千七百拾石六斗壹升三合 = 3,710.613 koku, which with this page's Mikawa rice of 1,423.8354 koku and the 0.593 koku of miscellaneous-tax rice comes to 5,135.0414 koku, i.e. 0.36 koku short of the printed total. The gold and cash totals below, by contrast, repeat their single source figures exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "合米"
      }
